# Secrets — contract §6. Nothing with a credential in it is ever committed.
.env
*.key
*.pem

# Per-app runtime state — contract §0.
#
# These directories live inside this checkout but are NOT source. They hold
# SQLite databases, generated API keys, cross-service tokens, session state and
# caches. They are listed explicitly rather than by a wildcard so that adding a
# service is a deliberate act: a new service's config directory will show up as
# untracked and make you decide, instead of being silently swallowed.
/jellyfin/
/prowlarr/
/sonarr/
/radarr/
/bazarr/
/jellyseerr/
/sabnzbd/
/qbittorrent/
# gluetun is deliberately absent: it has no volume mount and keeps no state on
# disk. This list means "services with state" — keep it meaning that.

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
.DS_Store
